I wouldn't wish for an artifact weapon anyway, other artifacts are far
more wish-worthy (as are magic markers, DSM, and a bunch of other
things).  As a Valk, I tend to avoid sacrificing if possible (aside
from converting altars) exactly because things like this can happen--
if I'm neutral, I want the Eye or Eyes, and as a lawful I've got a
better weapon (Excalibur) than anything I could get except Grayswandir
(which requires quite some luck and getting Mojo generated first).  As
a neutral, I'll sac post-Castle (once I've wished up the Eye) if I
haven't found a decent weapon yet, as Mojo is reasonable until pretty
late.

But finding Magicbane is quite nice, indeed!  If you lack MR, I'd go
with it until you find another source; obviously, keep it in main inv
and keep the 1-turn E ability in mind. I'd also use it in the late
game for curse absorption (though switching to a heavier hitter
briefly when needed).



